    "name": "Our Journey: The Silent Voice",
    "steam_appid": 2720730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/d2152b7c5db813624403e3ce7af39d7b.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span><strong>Embark on a unique co-op journey with a friend.</strong> <br>Play two different roles: the Hero and his Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate throughout your journey to find the artifacts that will bring you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/24c1c5c0ebc194502864ce9c2a61aeba.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spirit:</strong> Guide your partner through the world by playing symbols cards.<br><strong>Body:</strong> Determine your destination by comparing the received cards to the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/e78d5a84661d639e3753bea9a5d9a75a.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span><strong>Communicate without talking, communicate with the cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your vocabulary:</strong> Symbols cards.<br><strong>Your grammar:</strong> Artifacts allowing new card manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/c32edbc96647a5f886b90dad7bd0f14e.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span>Discover other civilisations and beautiful places.<br>Your encounters will help you understand this enigmatic world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/d2152b7c5db813624403e3ce7af39d7b.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span><strong>Embark on a unique co-op journey with a friend.</strong> <br>Play two different roles: the Hero and his Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate throughout your journey to find the artifacts that will bring you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/24c1c5c0ebc194502864ce9c2a61aeba.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spirit:</strong> Guide your partner through the world by playing symbols cards.<br><strong>Body:</strong> Determine your destination by comparing the received cards to the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/e78d5a84661d639e3753bea9a5d9a75a.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span><strong>Communicate without talking, communicate with the cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your vocabulary:</strong> Symbols cards.<br><strong>Your grammar:</strong> Artifacts allowing new card manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/c32edbc96647a5f886b90dad7bd0f14e.avif?t=1754567406\" width=600 height=200 /></span>Discover other civilisations and beautiful places.<br>Your encounters will help you understand this enigmatic world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Our Journey: The Silent Voice is a co-op (2 players) asymmetric adventure game. Communicate creatively with symbols to unveil the path to success. Find out who you really are by meeting intriguing characters and visiting new places.",
